      "message": "fuzz: check GetStale() returns exactly the stale private broadcast txs\n\nCurrently, the private_broadcast harness checks that each transaction\nreturned by GetStale() is known, unresolved and below the attempt cap.\nThis adds onto that by checking the timing rule, and that every stale\ntransaction is returned.\n\nTrack when each transaction is added and when each node confirms\nreception, and check that GetStale() returns exactly the expected set.",
